    [3103]={name="Coldridge Hammer",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Protecting the Herd” — pick it over the other choices. In Dun Morogh.",zone="Dun Morogh",questName="Protecting the Herd",lore="We heard the cries in the middle of the night. Then this morning, sure enough, the herd was missing two rams. That dastardly beast known as Vagash has been preying on our livelihood."},
    [3160]={name="Ironplate Buckler",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Filthy Paws” — pick it over the other choices. In Loch Modan.",zone="Loch Modan",questName="Filthy Paws",lore="The Silver Stream Mine to the east ran dry long ago. It was converted by the Miners' League into a storage depot, but now Kobolds have moved in, putting their filthy paws on good, Dwarven tools!"},
