    [16863]={name="Gauntlets of Might",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lucifron in Molten Core.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Lucifron",lore="The first of Ragnaros's lieutenants a raid meets, and the one that turns your own spells against you."},
    [16886]={name="Outlaw Sabre",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Baron Aquanis” — pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Baron Aquanis",lore="The defeated water elemental has left behind a strange water globe. You surmise that the object somehow fed the beast energy. Inside the globe, a putrid-looking form of water sloshes about."},
    [16959]={name="Bracelets of Wrath",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Razorgore the Untamed in Blackwing Lair.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Razorgore the Untamed",lore="Set to guard the stolen dragon eggs. The raid takes control of the orb he is chained to and turns him on the clutch he was protecting."},
    [16961]={name="Pauldrons of Wrath",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Chromaggus in Blackwing Lair.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Chromaggus",lore="Nefarian's best result: a two-headed chromatic horror carrying the breath of every dragonflight at once."},
    [16962]={name="Legplates of Wrath",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ragnaros.",npc="Ragnaros",lore="The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain. The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."},
    [16963]={name="Helm of Wrath",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Onyxia in Onyxia's Lair.",zone="Onyxia's Lair",npc="Onyxia",lore="Deathwing's daughter and Nefarian's sister. She spent years in Stormwind as Lady Katrana Prestor, advising the throne she was working to undermine."},
    [16964]={name="Gauntlets of Wrath",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ebonroc in Blackwing Lair.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Ebonroc",lore="One of three drakes guarding Nefarian's inner lair, and the one that heals itself off the wounds it deals."},
    [16965]={name="Sabatons of Wrath",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Broodlord Lashlayer in Blackwing Lair.",zone="Blackwing Lair",npc="Broodlord Lashlayer",lore="Nefarian's lieutenant, posted to hold the only way deeper into the lair."},
    [16966]={name="Breastplate of Wrath",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Nefarian.",npc="Nefarian",lore="Deathwing's son, working under Blackrock Mountain to breed the chromatic flight -- dragons carrying the blood of all five. He spent years in Stormwind's court as Lord Victor Nefarius while the work went on."},
    [16978]={name="Warsong Gauntlets",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Warsong Supplies” — pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="Warsong Supplies",lore="We are in short supply of a few items at the Warsong lumber camp!"},
    [16986]={name="Sandspire Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “New Life” — pick it over the other choices. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="New Life",lore="As you have seen, though the land is in pain, the cycle of life is a powerful thing. Now we must do our part help it along. You must plant these seeds at the center of the destruction, to the west, in the Charred Vale."},
    [16996]={name="Gorewood Bow",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria” — pick it over the other choices. In Eastern Plaguelands.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria",lore="Demetria is chief advisor to the Grand Crusader. She is called the Oracle due to her 'otherworldly' senses. She has successfully assisted the Crusade in several of their victories against the Scourge."},
    [17006]={name="Cobalt Legguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “King of the Foulweald” — pick it over the other choices. In Ashenvale.",zone="Ashenvale",questName="King of the Foulweald",lore="another tribe of Furbolgs, the Foulweald, live southeast of Astranaar. They are not as many as the Thistlefur, but their ferocity poses a future threat."},
    [17013]={name="Dark Iron Leggings",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [17014]={name="Dark Iron Bracers",sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Blacksmithing (requires skill 1).",profession="Blacksmithing"},
    [17063]={name="Band of Accuria",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ragnaros.",npc="Ragnaros",lore="The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain. The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."},
    [17065]={name="Medallion of Steadfast Might",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Magmadar in Molten Core.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Magmadar",lore="A core hound of the deep fire, kept as a guard beast and fed by Ragnaros's lieutenants."},
    [17069]={name="Striker's Mark",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Magmadar in Molten Core.",zone="Molten Core",npc="Magmadar",lore="A core hound of the deep fire, kept as a guard beast and fed by Ragnaros's lieutenants."},
    [17076]={name="Bonereaver's Edge",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ragnaros.",npc="Ragnaros",lore="Bonereaver's Edge strips the armour off whatever it hits. Ragnaros's court had little use for subtlety.",proc="Chance on hit: Your attacks ignore 700 of your enemies' armor for 10 sec. This effect stacks up to 3 times."},
    [17185]={name="Round Buckler",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Sana in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",npc="Sana"},
    [17186]={name="Small Targe",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Treall in The Exodar.",zone="The Exodar",npc="Treall"},
    [17694]={name="Band of the Fist",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Allegiance to the Old Gods” — pick it over the other choices. In Blackfathom Deeps.",zone="Blackfathom Deeps",questName="Allegiance to the Old Gods",lore="This Twilight's Hammer follower cannot be allowed to complete his plan. The Twilight's Hammer do not understand the spirits of nature. They believe in the Old Gods--creatures of chaos and destruction that were long ago defeated."},
    [17711]={name="Elemental Rockridge Leggings",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Princess Theradras in Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Princess Theradras",lore="A princess of the earth elementals and the reason Maraudon is poisoned -- she holds the body of Zaetar, her demigod consort, at its heart."},
    [17713]={name="Blackstone Ring",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Princess Theradras in Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Princess Theradras",lore="A princess of the earth elementals and the reason Maraudon is poisoned -- she holds the body of Zaetar, her demigod consort, at its heart."},
    [17714]={name="Bracers of the Stone Princess",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Princess Theradras in Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Princess Theradras",lore="A princess of the earth elementals and the reason Maraudon is poisoned -- she holds the body of Zaetar, her demigod consort, at its heart."},
    [17730]={name="Gatorbite Axe",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Rotgrip in Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Rotgrip",proc="Chance on hit: Wounds the target causing them to bleed for 230 damage over 30 sec."},
    [17734]={name="Helm of the Mountain",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Landslide in Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Landslide"},
    [17739]={name="Grovekeeper's Drape",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Celebras the Cursed in Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Celebras the Cursed"},
    [17746]={name="Noxxion's Shackles",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Noxxion in Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Noxxion"},
    [17752]={name="Satyr's Lash",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Vyletongue in Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Lord Vyletongue",proc="Chance on hit: Sends a shadowy bolt at the enemy causing 55 to 85 Shadow damage."},
    [17767]={name="Bloomsprout Headpiece",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Meshlok the Harvester in Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",npc="Meshlok the Harvester"},
    [17772]={name="Zealous Shadowshard Pendant",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Shadowshard Fragments” — pick it over the other choices. In Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Shadowshard Fragments",lore="The Desolace tribes of centaur protect that place wit' their lives, but they canna stop us from takin' what we need. You, you head to this Maraudon place and find the rock creatures made of shadowshard."},
    [17779]={name="Hulkstone Pauldrons",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Twisted Evils” — pick it over the other choices. In Maraudon.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Twisted Evils",lore="The crystal caverns of Terramok lie to the west, deep within Maraudon... It is an ancient place with much history. And I am looking to get my hands on some of it."},
    [17904]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 6",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Eye of Command”. In Alterac Valley.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Eye of Command",lore="Your time has come again. You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar."},
    [17909]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 6",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Eye of Command”. In Alterac Valley.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Eye of Command",lore="You have earned the Eye of Command. Present your insignia, Commander.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep."},
